    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McKenna Healy are delighted to present this exceptional and highly versatile six-bedroom property, ideally positioned within the popular Hampton Cove development in Balbriggan.\n\nTHE MAIN HOUSE FOUR BEDROOMS\n\nThe main house offers bright and spacious accommodation throughout, with a welcoming entrance hallway leading into generous living areas.\nThe property benefits from a well-presented living room, a spacious kitchen and dining area, four bedrooms and two bathrooms. The bedrooms are well proportioned, with a good mix of double and single rooms, providing plenty of space for comfortable living.\n\nSEPARATE REAR HOUSE TWO BEDROOMS\n\nOne of the standout features of this property is the completely separate two-bedroom accommodation to the rear.\n\nThis additional property offers its own kitchen, living room, two bedrooms and bathroom, providing an excellent level of independent living space. It is a fantastic addition to the property and gives the home a flexibility that is rarely available in a standard rental.\n\nOUTDOOR SPACE\n\nThe property also benefits from private outdoor space, providing a pleasant area to enjoy outside and adding further to the overall appeal of the home.\n\nLOCATION\n\nHampton Cove is a popular and well-established development, ideally located close to Balbriggan town centre and a wide range of local amenities, including shops, restaurants, schools and recreational facilities.\n\nBalbriggan train station and local bus services are within easy reach, while the M1 motorway provides convenient access towards Dublin City and surrounding areas."
      },
